sequenceDiagram
participant U as User
participant I as Ingress
participant S as SemDB
participant C as PTR Core
participant R as Runtime
participant P as Pod
participant V as Verifier
participant L as Ledger
U->>I: raw input
I->>S: verified semantic delta
S->>C: immutable snapshot rN
C->>R: PodRequested / ModelEvent
R->>P: typed request
P-->>R: observation
R->>V: verify observation
V->>S: committed evidence delta
S->>C: snapshot rN+1
C->>R: ActionReady
R->>V: hard action boundary
V-->>R: pass/fail
R->>L: durable semantic/action event
